codex
I found and isolated the environment defect: this sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` but hides `/proc/<numeric-pid>/exe`, while Lean 4.22 hard-codes the numeric path. A narrow preload shim redirects only that equivalent self-executable lookup; Lean now reports the exact pinned commit. I’m rerunning the unmodified trusted checker with that compatibility fix, preserving both earlier failures and the shim source.
