+source order:
+
+| Lines | `source_rule_id` | Independent class |
+|---|---|---|
+| 13 | `rule-3f798b6fd39a42a7d25fd8002e3066da3e8617d612075a0b0f57d6d6f522737d` | `DEFINITION` |
